# #131 Uther's native check by parity: Holy Light's return hit pulls b toward Uther, Holy Light
# returning untouched heals him 3, a strike on Divine Shield's guard raises Divine Shield, the next
# strike passes until his jab, and a grab beats the guard. Uther a against Uther b, a melee partner;
# syntax and checks: smashcraft:docs/native-bot-session.md.
#! chat -dev quick hero uther
# Both dash in.
40 a stick 1 0
40 b stick -1 0
42 a stick 0 0
42 b stick 0 0
# Holy Light; b spot-dodges it going out, so only its return strikes b, pulling b toward Uther.
60 a tap X 2
82 b shield 1
83 b stick 0 -1
84 b stick 0 0
86 b shield 0
# b dashes in and jabs a.
135 b stick -1 0
137 b stick 0 0
170 b tap A 2
# a turns away from b; his Holy Light flies out and back untouched and heals him 3.
185 a stick -0.4 0
188 a stick 0 0
195 a tap X 2
# b dashes and walks up to a.
275 b stick -1 0
277 b stick 0 0
292 b press LB
292 b stick -1 0
304 b stick 0 0
304 b release LB
# b's jab meets Divine Shield's guard on its frame 3: Divine Shield is up.
320 a stick 0 -1
320 a tap X 2
321 a stick 0 0
322 b tap A 2
# b's next jab passes through him.
350 b tap A 2
# His own jab ends Divine Shield; b's next jab lands.
365 a tap A 2
380 b tap A 2
# A grab on the guard's frame 4 beats it.
420 a stick 0 -1
420 a tap X 2
421 a stick 0 0
423 b tap RB 2
# Expected, frame by frame (headless run of this script):
# Holy Light: b dodged it going out; its return strikes b, pulling b toward Uther.
#! expect a 60 special 13 form 0
#! absent b 61-114 damage
#! expect b 115 damage 5.000
#! expect b 170 applied attack 1 style 0
#! expect a 174 damage 4.000
# Holy Light returns untouched and heals a 3.
#! expect a 195 special 13 form 0
#! absent b 196-267 damage
#! expect a 268 damage 1.000
# The guard takes b's jab and raises Divine Shield (45 frames); b's next jab passes.
#! expect a 320 special 16 form 0
#! expect b 322 applied attack 2 style 0
#! expect b 350 applied attack 3 style 0
#! absent a 320-383 damage
# His jab ends it; b's next jab lands.
#! expect a 365 applied attack 1 style 0
#! expect b 380 applied attack 4 style 0
#! expect a 384 damage 5.000
# b's grab on the guard catches him.
#! expect a 420 special 16 form 0
#! expect b 423 applied attack 5 style 5
#! expect b 430 grab-hold start
#! scene a HolyBoltMissile
#! scene a HealTarget
#! scene a DivineShieldTarget
# View held a second: the first of two moments the parity check replays.
500 a press VIEW
570 a release VIEW
1000 a press VIEW
1070 a release VIEW
